stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : limit sell submitted (entry or repair)
    Pending --> Pending : poll state · amend on ask drift
    Pending --> Open : fully filled
    Pending --> Open : timeout / rejected with partial fill → book filled qty
    Pending --> [*] : timeout with nothing filled → slot released
    Open --> Open : marks + greeks refreshed each cycle
    Open --> Closing : stop-loss · roll rule · GEX shed · kill switch · rebalance
    Closing --> Open : partial fill → qty reduced, rules re-checked next cycle
    Closing --> Closed : fully bought back
    Closed --> [*] : removed from book · P&L in orders.log
    note right of Open
        A strangle with one leg Open and one missing
        is completed by repair (same expiry, entry delta,
        same size) unless GEX is shedding that leg type.
    end note
